1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,051
Every trading bot has a perfect track record.

2
00:00:03,501 --> 00:00:06,880
The catch? It's always written after the market moves.

3
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:09,188
So we built the opposite.

4
00:00:09,588 --> 00:00:11,000
Meet Fabius.

5
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:15,263
It seals every signal on BNB Chain, before the market answers.

6
00:00:16,063 --> 00:00:17,381
First, the rules.

7
00:00:17,681 --> 00:00:23,079
Each bot's strategy is locked on-chain, so it can't be quietly rewritten after a bad day.

8
00:00:23,779 --> 00:00:26,815
Every day, the candle closes, the bot makes its call,

9
00:00:26,965 --> 00:00:30,565
and Fabius seals it with a timestamp no one can change.

10
00:00:30,585 --> 00:00:31,792
Not even us.

11
00:00:32,592 --> 00:00:35,998
Who picks the bot? A desk of AI agents.

12
00:00:36,348 --> 00:00:41,324
Every five minutes, analysts with their own on-chain identities make their picks,

13
00:00:41,474 --> 00:00:47,035
and a locked formula turns them into one paper portfolio, sealed before the cycle ends.

14
00:00:47,835 --> 00:00:48,930
Want today's signal?

15
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:54,392
Get it on the web, in Telegram, or let your AI agent fetch it over MCP.

16
00:00:54,692 --> 00:00:57,229
Pay per signal with x402.

17
00:00:57,249 --> 00:01:01,099
No gas, no subscription, and it arrives with its proof.

18
00:01:01,899 --> 00:01:03,377
Then check it yourself.

19
00:01:03,627 --> 00:01:05,464
Pick any bot, any day.

20
00:01:05,484 --> 00:01:09,003
Fabius rebuilds the signal from public data and the chain.

21
00:01:09,303 --> 00:01:11,415
No key. No gas.

22
00:01:12,165 --> 00:01:15,185
Got your own bot, or your own agent? Bring it.

23
00:01:15,435 --> 00:01:18,044
It faces the same public gates as ours.

24
00:01:18,844 --> 00:01:22,600
No profit promises. It's paper money on testnet,

25
00:01:22,750 --> 00:01:26,060
and zero of six bots have passed the forward test yet.

26
00:01:26,510 --> 00:01:27,980
Fabius waits for proof.

27
00:01:28,530 --> 00:01:30,275
Don't trust. Check it.

